{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KY2vSzr6X4yrTSJmEtc9CD","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t//! Feature-based scoring for Retrieval V1 candidates.\n2\t//!\n3\t//! `docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md`\n4\t//! `## 7. Retrieval Engine` defines the ranking signal contract:\n5\t//!\n6\t//! | Signal | Required input |\n7\t//! | --- | --- |\n8\t//! | task-type compatibility | `IntentClassification` and candidate source/kind |\n9\t//! | graph proximity to anchors | resolved anchors, seed anchor, traversal path |\n10\t//! | exact identifier match | resolved anchors and identity text |\n11\t//! | semantic similarity | embedding or caller-provided similarity score |\n12\t//! | verification status | memory verification metadata |\n13\t//! | freshness | memory/event recency metadata |\n14\t//! | scope | memory scope metadata |\n15\t//! | evidence strength | memory confidence and evidence metadata |\n16\t//! | contradiction/supersession state | structured memory contradiction/supersession metadata |\n17\t//! | past usefulness | memory access or retrieval event history |\n18\t//! | recent successful reuse | workflow success history |\n19\t//! | user preference compatibility | observed preference metadata |\n20\t//! | token cost | token estimate metadata |\n21\t\n22\tuse std::collections::BTreeMap;\n23\t\n24\tuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\n25\t\n26\tuse crate::memory::{MemoryScope, MemoryVerificationStatus};\n27\t\n28\tuse super::scoring_support::*;\n29\tuse super::{Candidate, CandidateSource, IntentClassification, ResolvedAnchor};\n30\t\n31\tconst FRESHNESS_WINDOW_SECONDS: u64 = 60 * 60 * 24 * 30;\n32\tconst HIGH_TOKEN_COST: u32 = 4_000;\n33\t\n34\t#[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq, PartialOrd, Ord, Hash, Serialize, Deserialize)]\n35\tpub enum SignalKind {\n36\t    TaskTypeCompatibility,\n37\t    GraphProximity,\n38\t    ExactIdentifierMatch,\n39\t    SemanticSimilarity,\n40\t    VerificationStatus,\n41\